{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/c504d68866507f4ef2a048e0ffa111cd.avif?t=1765078476\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lone Survivors is a objective and time-based survivors game. Fight off hordes of enemies with weapons that automatically attack, while you use a <i>single class-specific ability</i> to help you survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock Unique Abilities That Fight For You\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/99e02631d794ea642c91ab9430ce267e.avif?t=1765078476\" width=768 height=139 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout each adventure in a level, you will be offered the opportunity to select from a variety of weaponry, magic, and traps to defeat your enemies, <strong>featuring</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 unique classes, each with their own progression trees - play as a Barbarian, a Warrior, a Mage, or even a Necromancer!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 13 unique weapons, each with their own legendary upgrades and special rare upgrades - from explosive Dynamite to chilling Ice Spikes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 30 unique meta-progression upgrades - ranging from Electrically Charged Turrets to making yourself a Rage-Infused Barbarian!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/224140a0b966f23a12fa3a88afe8446f.poster.avif?t=1765078476\" width=610 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/224140a0b966f23a12fa3a88afe8446f.webm?t=1765078476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/224140a0b966f23a12fa3a88afe8446f.mp4?t=1765078476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Battle in Unique Locations and Fight a Variety of Monsters\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the campaign mode, completing objectives to uncover the mystery of the island you are on, to an endless mode where you battle until the enemies overwhelm you to achieve the highest survival time, there is endless content to keep you engaged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/057fb7b3bef7531d8ac78d669532beed.avif?t=1765078476\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras_big/057fb7b3bef7531d8ac78d669532beed.avif?t=1765078476 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four unique biomes, with eight different Locations within the Biomes, one for Endless and one for Survival each! Traverse through a forest, a deadly trap-filled dungeon, sandy island beach, and the fiery pits of a volcano!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 20 different types of enemies - from Rats to Ghouls to Wizards and Floating Skulls!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Bosses to overcome, with plenty of Unique Elite enemies to encounter along the way!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend to higher difficulties after completing the game, providing even more challenge with additional boss phases, new types of enemies, and greater the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/a811443de6ce6901efc7899d8de1efad.poster.avif?t=1765078476\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/a811443de6ce6901efc7899d8de1efad.webm?t=1765078476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">It doesn't always have to be violent...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Take a break from the fighting, and enjoy some minigames at your hub!</strong> Take part in blacksmithing - improve your equipment for your next battles or be adventurous and try to catch your own fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/f6e2743d7137c03c72fe844cb2d6cc5e.poster.avif?t=1765078476\" width=1064 height=602 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/f6e2743d7137c03c72fe844cb2d6cc5e.webm?t=1765078476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/f6e2743d7137c03c72fe844cb2d6cc5e.mp4?t=1765078476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629280?t=1765078476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/d91241e4a2aaa2497de92f1b07a9342926f9c462/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765078476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/c05ed219035670bfbc8963083ede0035ab30dfb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765078476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/c05ed219035670bfbc8963083ede0035ab30dfb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765078476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3720490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/c504d68866507f4ef2a048e0ffa111cd.avif?t=1765078476\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lone Survivors is a objective and time-based survivors game. Fight off hordes of enemies with weapons that automatically attack, while you use a <i>single class-specific ability</i> to help you survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock Unique Abilities That Fight For You\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/99e02631d794ea642c91ab9430ce267e.avif?t=1765078476\" width=768 height=139 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout each adventure in a level, you will be offered the opportunity to select from a variety of weaponry, magic, and traps to defeat your enemies, <strong>featuring</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 unique classes, each with their own progression trees - play as a Barbarian, a Warrior, a Mage, or even a Necromancer!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 13 unique weapons, each with their own legendary upgrades and special rare upgrades - from explosive Dynamite to chilling Ice Spikes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 30 unique meta-progression upgrades - ranging from Electrically Charged Turrets to making yourself a Rage-Infused Barbarian!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/224140a0b966f23a12fa3a88afe8446f.poster.avif?t=1765078476\" width=610 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/224140a0b966f23a12fa3a88afe8446f.webm?t=1765078476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/224140a0b966f23a12fa3a88afe8446f.mp4?t=1765078476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Battle in Unique Locations and Fight a Variety of Monsters\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the campaign mode, completing objectives to uncover the mystery of the island you are on, to an endless mode where you battle until the enemies overwhelm you to achieve the highest survival time, there is endless content to keep you engaged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/057fb7b3bef7531d8ac78d669532beed.avif?t=1765078476\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras_big/057fb7b3bef7531d8ac78d669532beed.avif?t=1765078476 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four unique biomes, with eight different Locations within the Biomes, one for Endless and one for Survival each! Traverse through a forest, a deadly trap-filled dungeon, sandy island beach, and the fiery pits of a volcano!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 20 different types of enemies - from Rats to Ghouls to Wizards and Floating Skulls!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Bosses to overcome, with plenty of Unique Elite enemies to encounter along the way!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend to higher difficulties after completing the game, providing even more challenge with additional boss phases, new types of enemies, and greater the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/a811443de6ce6901efc7899d8de1efad.poster.avif?t=1765078476\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/a811443de6ce6901efc7899d8de1efad.webm?t=1765078476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">It doesn't always have to be violent...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Take a break from the fighting, and enjoy some minigames at your hub!</strong> Take part in blacksmithing - improve your equipment for your next battles or be adventurous and try to catch your own fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/f6e2743d7137c03c72fe844cb2d6cc5e.poster.avif?t=1765078476\" width=1064 height=602 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/f6e2743d7137c03c72fe844cb2d6cc5e.webm?t=1765078476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/f6e2743d7137c03c72fe844cb2d6cc5e.mp4?t=1765078476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["GreatColtini Industries"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/8a8940ab1369a4332bf733cc3b28cba259689783/header.jpg?t=1765078476","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3629280/1647778279/6f70f6ccdbcedbfa4365436a9904e371b44fab2e/1763342099/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763342581","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3629280/1647778279/6f70f6ccdbcedbfa4365436a9904e371b44fab2e/1763342099/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763342581","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3629280/1647778279/6f70f6ccdbcedbfa4365436a9904e371b44fab2e/1763342099/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763342581","id":257135349,"name":"Lone Survivors - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257135349/f8b39acaa2d65c02133de0a581c3e4b